# Doc Aurlock, Grizzled Genius: "Spells you cast from your graveyard or from exile cost {2} less to cast." A card in a
# graveyard is in its owner's (CR 404.1), so a card Bot1 casts from Bot2's graveyard was not cast from Bot1's. Bot2 loots its
# Mind Stone away with Faithless Looting on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1's Tinybones hits Bot2 and Bot1 casts the Mind Stone from
# Bot2's graveyard: it costs its full {2}, which Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby pay with nothing left over.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Tinybones, the Pickpocket
Doc Aurlock, Grizzled Genius
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Mind Stone
Island x17

